1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:00,850
Tempe...

2
00:00:00,850 --> 00:00:02,775
atau telur?

3
00:00:02,775 --> 00:00:03,607
Protein siapa

4
00:00:03,607 --> 00:00:04,836
yang lebih tinggi?

5
00:00:06,006 --> 00:00:07,760
Jawabannya...

6
00:00:07,760 --> 00:00:08,474
TEMPE!

7
00:00:08,474 --> 00:00:09,206
Per seratus gram,

8
00:00:09,206 --> 00:00:10,706
tempe dua puluh gram protein,

9
00:00:10,706 --> 00:00:12,278
telur cuma dua belas!

10
00:00:12,278 --> 00:00:15,081
Tapi awas, ada jebakan angka...

11
00:00:15,081 --> 00:00:16,280
di akhir video.

12
00:00:16,280 --> 00:00:17,624
Rahasianya?

13
00:00:17,624 --> 00:00:18,445
Kedelai,

14
00:00:18,445 --> 00:00:20,088
kacang yang kaya protein.

15
00:00:20,088 --> 00:00:21,570
Lalu difermentasi

16
00:00:21,570 --> 00:00:23,642
jamur Rhizopus...

17
00:00:23,642 --> 00:00:24,987
jadi lebih gampang dicerna!

18
00:00:24,987 --> 00:00:26,299
Nah, ini jebakannya:

19
00:00:26,299 --> 00:00:28,323
angka tadi per seratus gram.

20
00:00:28,323 --> 00:00:30,620
Sebutir telur: tujuh setengah gram.

21
00:00:30,620 --> 00:00:32,469
Sepotong tempe tipis:

22
00:00:32,469 --> 00:00:33,728
cuma lima gram!

23
00:00:33,728 --> 00:00:34,924
Jadi...

24
00:00:34,924 --> 00:00:37,177
makan tempenya dua potong!

25
00:00:37,177 --> 00:00:39,459
Tempe: murah, asli Indonesia,

26
00:00:39,459 --> 00:00:41,905
tercatat sejak tahun seribu delapan ratusan!

27
00:00:41,905 --> 00:00:43,109
Kirim ke temanmu

28
00:00:43,109 --> 00:00:45,829
yang suka meremehkan tempe!

